#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Supplier portal and hub portal: the same design as the admin portal, in one go.
 *   Supplier (中文 + English): navy side menu with a gold strip on the chosen page, navy page header (small gold "LEAP 供应商", big white title,
 *     glass search and bell, gold avatar, the page's tabs on it), Manrope for English (Chinese stays Noto Sans SC), gold filter pills,
 *     cards with soft shadows and a gold mark on titles, raised navy first number on Overview and Finance, status badges with a dot,
 *     one table style (header band, roomy rows, stripes, gold hover, empty state), segmented tabs inside pages, a navy login screen.
 *   Hub (中文 + English): navy menu like the admin, navy Board header with a raised gold Scan button, raised board cards, gold queue pills,
 *     the chosen parcel in gold, gold instead of the old orange everywhere (navy text on it), status badges with a dot, the same tables,
 *     fields and focus rings, the page flush beside the menu, a navy login screen.
 * No API change.
 *   node scripts/patch-portals-redesign.js            dry run
 *   node scripts/patch-portals-redesign.js --write    applies it
 */
